  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, and let us return unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": for he hath torn, and he will heal us; he hath smitten, and he will bind us up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After two days will he revive us: in the third day he will raise us up, and we shall live in his sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall we know,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "we follow on to know the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": his going forth is prepared as the morning; and he shall come unto us as the rain, as the latter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "former rain unto the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ O Ephraim, what shall I do unto thee? O Judah, what shall I do unto thee? for your goodness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a morning cloud, and as the early dew it goeth away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore have I hewed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by the prophets; I have slain them by the words of my mouth: and thy judgments",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the light",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goeth forth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I desired mercy, and not sacrifice; and the knowledge of God more than burnt offerings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they like men have transgressed the covenant: there have they dealt treacherously against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a city of them that work iniquity,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "polluted with blood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And as troops of robbers wait for a man,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the company of priests murder in the way by consent: for they commit lewdness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen an horrible thing in the house of Israel: there",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the whoredom of Ephraim, Israel is defiled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also, O Judah, he hath set an harvest for thee, when I returned the captivity of my people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
